/**
 * The icon set from the 2026 brand kit, inlined as vectors rather than shipped as
 * files, so the icons inherit colour from the text around them and stay sharp at
 * any size. Two tones: the body follows `currentColor`, the highlight follows
 * `--icon-accent`, which a section can retint without touching this file.
 *
 * Generated from assets/icons/svg in the brand kit. Re-run the extraction there
 * rather than hand-editing the path data.
 */
